# Complete-claim gate v1 (thin · alwaysApply)

**Checker:** `py scripts/check_mkm_complete_claim_gate_v1.py --claim-text "…"`  
**Artifact:** `docs/final/artifacts/mkm_complete_claim_gate_v1_latest.json`  
**Adversarial:** `run_mkm_claim_adversarial_reread_v1.py` auto-runs this gate when claim matches 완성/COMPLETE/완료됐/product_all_ok/전면완성 (no extra flag).

## ALWAYS

- Before 완성 / COMPLETE / 전면완성 / product_all_ok / 완료됐: `check_mkm_complete_claim_gate_v1.py` exit **0** (agent runs CLI). Multi-step product claims: add `--receipt-json` (D1/D2). Adversarial auto-on for same tokens.

## NEVER

- Claim 「완성됐다」 / full COMPLETE without exit 0.
- Treat Done-card bare 「완료」 as this gate (`--claim-kind done_card` escape).
- Bypass with chat when disk completeness is PARTIAL / below bar.
